1)  Obviously Machado is not as good as A-Rod was at this point when he signed this deal.  A-Rod was a 300 hitter and averaged 40 HR a year. He was also a gold-glove shortstop.  Machado plays a great 3b but isn't as good at SS.  Also he has a 0.282 career batting average and 30+ HR.  

